# Pairs with InFlightBaseSurvives. The row becomes visible before the check
# runs - as it would if a capture registered first and checked afterwards -
# so a crash between the two leaves an unchecked increment published.
MODULE: InFlightBaseSurvivesCrashPublishesUnchecked
TARGET: InFlightBaseSurvives
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: a crash after the manifest write leaves the unchecked increment registered
PERTURBS: CaptureCrash

--- FIND
    /\ cap' = [cap EXCEPT ![c] = [ph |-> "idle", id |-> 0, t |-> 0]]
    /\ UNCHANGED <<now, pol, next, meta>>
    /\ UNCHANGED storeVars
--- REPLACE
    /\ cap' = [cap EXCEPT ![c] = [ph |-> "idle", id |-> 0, t |-> 0]]
    /\ UNCHANGED <<now, pol, next, meta>>
    \* MUTATION: the row was registered before the check.
    /\ cat' = IF cap[c].ph = "man" THEN cat \cup {cap[c].id} ELSE cat
    /\ pub' = IF cap[c].ph = "man" THEN pub \cup {cap[c].id} ELSE pub
    /\ UNCHANGED <<arts, snk, lpt, reps>>
--- END